      en: ["First documentary mention in the year 1135.", "Site of a significant Napoleonic battle on November 16, 1805.", "The Marian Column on the main square was built in 1713.", "Home to the \"Alte Hofmühle\" local history museum.", "Known as an educational hub with over 20 schools.", "Population of approximately 12,000 residents."],
